        "attribution": "Aharonov's work on the Aharonov-Bohm effect and Berry's formulation of geometric phase are identifiable contributions, though the discovery label combines distinct developments.",
        "maturity": "The phenomena have been repeatedly observed and are now basic tools in quantum theory and condensed matter physics.",
